  "goodToKnow": "Der Faden is a thread: Nadel und Faden. Many idioms use it: den Faden verlieren (to lose your train of thought), der rote Faden (the common thread or central theme, Goethe's image from ropes of the British navy), alle Fäden in der Hand halten (to pull all the strings), an einem seidenen Faden hängen (to hang by a thread). After surgery, die Fäden ziehen means to take out the stitches. Plural: die Fäden."
